{
  "events": [
    {
      "id": "first-meeting",
      "name": "宝黛初见",
      "trigger": {
        "type": "location",
        "conditions": [
          { "type": "compare", "field": "agent.jia-baoyu.position.roomId", "operator": "==", "value": "rongxitang" },
          { "type": "compare", "field": "agent.lin-daiyu.position.roomId", "operator": "==", "value": "rongxitang" },
          { "type": "compare", "field": "globalFlag.firstMeeting", "operator": "==", "value": false }
        ]
      },
      "priority": 100,
      "repeatable": false,
      "cooldown": 0,
      "effects": [
        { "type": "setFlag", "flag": "firstMeeting", "value": true },
        { "type": "relation", "target": "jia-baoyu", "field": "affection", "value": 15, "operator": "add" },
        { "type": "relation", "target": "lin-daiyu", "field": "affection", "value": 15, "operator": "add" },
        { "type": "log", "message": "贾宝玉与林黛玉初次相见，两人都觉得似曾相识。" }
      ],
      "scope": "agent",
      "dialogues": {
        "id": "first-meeting-dialogue",
        "entries": [
          {
            "id": "entry-1",
            "speaker": "narrator",
            "text": "黛玉进府，只见两个人搀着一位鬓发如银的老母迎上来，黛玉便知是她外祖母。",
            "next": "entry-2"
          },
          {
            "id": "entry-2",
            "speaker": "贾母",
            "text": "我这些儿女，所疼者独有你母，今日一旦先舍我而去，连面也不能一见，今见了你，怎能不伤心！",
            "next": "entry-3"
          },
          {
            "id": "entry-3",
            "speaker": "narrator",
            "text": "一语未了，只听外面一阵脚步响，丫鬟进来笑道：\"宝玉来了！\"",
            "next": "entry-4"
          },
          {
            "id": "entry-4",
            "speaker": "贾宝玉",
            "text": "这个妹妹我曾见过的。",
            "emotion": "惊喜",
            "choices": [
              {
                "id": "choice-1",
                "text": "（好奇）你如何说这话？",
                "next": "entry-5"
              },
              {
                "id": "choice-2",
                "text": "（害羞低头）",
                "next": "entry-6"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "entry-5",
            "speaker": "贾宝玉",
            "text": "虽然未曾见过他，然我看着面善，心里就算是旧相识，今日只作远别重逢，亦未为不可。",
            "next": "entry-7"
          },
          {
            "id": "entry-6",
            "speaker": "narrator",
            "text": "黛玉听了，心中暗自称奇，脸上却更加飞红了。",
            "next": "entry-7"
          },
          {
            "id": "entry-7",
            "speaker": "narrator",
            "text": "宝玉走近黛玉身边坐下，又细细打量一番，因问：\"妹妹可曾读书？\"",
            "next": "entry-8"
          },
          {
            "id": "entry-8",
            "speaker": "林黛玉",
            "text": "不曾读，只上了一年学，些须认得几个字。",
            "next": "entry-9"
          },
          {
            "id": "entry-9",
            "speaker": "narrator",
            "text": "宝玉又问可有玉没有，黛玉道：\"我没有那个。想来那玉是一件罕物，岂能人人有的。\"",
            "next": "entry-10"
          },
          {
            "id": "entry-10",
            "speaker": "贾宝玉",
            "text": "什么稀罕之物，我也不要了！",
            "emotion": "愤怒",
            "next": "entry-11"
          },
          {
            "id": "entry-11",
            "speaker": "narrator",
            "text": "说着便狠命摔去。众人忙劝，黛玉心中十分不安，暗想因自己一句话倒惹出这样事来。",
            "next": null
          }
        ]
      }
    },
